flowchart TD
    A[Start Solve] --> B[Receive originalWords + history]

    B --> C[Create empty filtered list]

    C --> D[Loop through each word]

    D --> E[Assume word is valid]

    E --> F[Loop through each constraint]

    F --> G[Compare word to guess]

    G --> H[Count positional matches]

    H --> I{Matches == expected?}

    I -->|No| J[Mark word invalid]
    I -->|Yes| K[Continue checking]

    J --> L[Break constraint loop]

    K --> M{More constraints?}
    M -->|Yes| F
    M -->|No| N[Word is valid]

    L --> O{More words?}
    N --> O

    O -->|Yes| D
    O -->|No| P[Return filtered list]

    P --> Q[End]